5
00:03:28.000 --> 00:04:04.000
impensatory behaviors like purging or excessive exercise afterwards. And then actually, the most common eating disorder is what's called other specified feeding and eating disorder. And this is just a catch-all category for any other type of problematic eating that is causing impairment and distress in the person's life. And other specified feeding or eating disorder are osfed for short. That's a mouthful, right? is actually 50% of all people with an eating disorder would have OSFED.

6
00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:45.000
