00:08:54.000 --> 00:09:48.000
clear what the reasoning is for why they want to cut those foods out. You might notice that they're starting to take food to their bedrooms, or maybe they are starting to push their food more around the plate and not finish it. Other things to look for are isolation. So if your kids starting to not do activities that they used to do. Maybe they're going to their room instead of hanging out with the family. You might also notice kids starting to wear baggy or clothes to try to hide their body, or they might start to feel really uncomfortable, maybe going to the pool in a bathing suit. All of these things are signs that there might be an eating disorder developing. And what I would really urge parents to do is to keep an eye on what your kid is eating. So I know that when kids start to go

14
